              "content": "theme.label and theme.success resolve to the same colour, and kv_line styles every field label with theme.success rather than theme.label. Every label in the report is therefore green, and theme.label is only ever reached by empty-state text and the two export captions. Two tokens, one colour, and the one named for the job is the one not used.",
