              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "content_heights counts logical Lines, but the Paragraph wraps. Any line that soft-wraps makes the real rendered height exceed the measured height, so the clamp, the [n/total] counter and the scrollbar all under-report on a narrow terminal, and G cannot reach the true bottom.",
