                      "name": "T",
                      "fill": "$accent",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The default theme is the Palette, and a test says so",
                      "lineHeight": 1.35,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "DRAGH",
                      "name": "D",
                      "fill": "$ink-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "default_theme_matches_the_palette pins the accent, success, warning and error slots of solarxy-amber to solarxy_core::theme::Palette's roles. The Palette therefore still owns the shipped identity even though the mechanism is now a file, and a real if narrower form of the drift guarantee survives.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "tFzMQ",
                  "name": "Bundled themes compile",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 3,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "HuMPj",
                      "name": "T",
                      "fill": "$accent",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Bundled themes compile in",
                      "lineHeight": 1.35,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "XrOqc",
                      "name": "D",
                      "fill": "$ink-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "include_str! rather than an install path, so a theme cannot go missing between a package manager and a home directory. User themes are discovered from ~/.config/solarxy/tui-themes/*.toml and layered on top.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "vLFDc",
                  "name": "A theme cannot break c",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 3,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ZQYbE",
                      "name": "T",
                      "fill": "$accent",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A theme cannot break contrast silently",
                      "lineHeight": 1.35,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "l7pI1A",
                      "name": "D",
                      "fill": "$ink-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The loader rejects a theme whose ink and ground fall below the contrast floor, names the offending slot pair, and falls back to the default rather than rendering something unreadable.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "NdlVj",
                  "name": "design/README.md gains",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 3,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "xmq55",
                      "name": "T",
                      "fill": "$accent",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "design/README.md gains an exception, not a contradiction",
                      "lineHeight": 1.35,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "mgqfk",
                      "name": "D",
                      "fill": "$ink-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Its claim that the Palette is the single colour source stops being true for this shell. The amendment says so plainly and states the reason, rather than leaving a rule everyone can see is violated.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
