              "name": "Sub",
              "fill": "$ink-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Panels are leaves of a binary split tree. Every split names a direction and a ratio, so a layout is a small serialisable structure rather than a bag of rectangles, and it survives a resize by re-solving rather than by remembering pixels.",
