                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "An orthographic projection from the vertex positions ModelAnalyzer already holds for the whole session. No new data, no new I/O, no new dependency. The axis cycles with x, and the projection is depth-sorted with density falloff so a dense mesh reads as a form rather than a solid blob.",
