              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Validation is the panel the delivery-QA journey turns on, so it gets the widest slot and the only jump action in the design. Textures and Bounds give the remaining report data a home rather than leaving it in a scrolling block.",
